    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-στροφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>much-twisted,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.107
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mesom.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>versatile,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					214
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν γνώμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					6.131
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>making many turns,</i> of a dancer, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				30.108
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡνιοχεύς</span> (of a steersman)
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				40.464
			</span></i>.</div>
